<title>JAPAN: Mitsui High-tec - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsui High-tec - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.74		vs	   15.19</p>
<p> Operating	    2.39		vs	    1.96</p>
<p> Current		2.34		vs	    2.01</p>
<p> Net		    1.29		vs	    1.10</p>
